  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve04",
      "hash64": "530F6C48C19F48DD",
      "text": "聽說學生會長妮莫\\n她對寶可夢的招式效果\\r\\n全部都瞭如指掌。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve05",
      "hash64": "530F6B48C19F472A",
      "text": "我的帕奇利茲\\n牠很喜歡高的地方喔～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve07",
      "hash64": "530F6948C19F43C4",
      "text": "我從朋友那裡交換來了鬼斯通之後，\\n牠就進化成耿鬼了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve08",
      "hash64": "530F6048C19F3479",
      "text": "進化以後的寶可夢\\n原來這麼大隻啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve09",
      "hash64": "530F5F48C19F32C6",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni01",
      "hash64": "6D85DE7704923977",
      "text": "比起在自己的房間，\\n還是在教室讀書更有效率。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni02",
      "hash64": "6D85DF7704923B2A",
      "text": "晚上的時候，\\n不覺得有很多幽靈屬性的寶可夢嗎？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni03",
      "hash64": "6D85E07704923CDD",
      "text": "即使是相同的寶可夢，\\n太晶屬性也會不一樣，很有趣吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni04",
      "hash64": "6D85D977049230F8",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni05",
      "hash64": "6D85DA77049232AB",
      "text": "我是透過魔法交換\\n和這隻寶寶丁相遇的！\\c\\n在這世界某個地方的某個人，\\n謝謝你～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
